# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-SVKPN`.
#
# The property is the product one, at the layer that owns it: a harness that
# prints N lines and exits must have all N in the session, and a run_complete
# synthesized from them. The daemon-level symptom (a dispatch orphaned as
# protocol_end_without_finalize with an empty transcript) is downstream of this
# and is load-dependent, so it is proved by the pinned A/B rounds in the report,
# not by this probe — see README.md.
#
# The name filter already excludes everything else in the binary; the explicit
# `--skip` of the billed harness test is the suite's mandatory guard, asserted
# by `orgasmic verify` itself, and is kept even under a filter that cannot reach
# it so the guard never has to trust the filter.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-drivers --test driver_modes -- a_fast_exiting_harness_loses_no_stdout_to_the_release_race --skip legacy_drivers_and_explicit_pairs_emit_equivalent_start_events
